<h2>Research</h2>

<p>I am currently involved in research with <a href="https://yongxin.ae.gatech.edu">Prof. Yongxin Chen</a> and <a href="https://xavihart.github.io">Haotian Xue</a> at Georgia Tech,
focusing on protecting images against adversarial image/video generation models.</p>

<p>Some current research interests include <em>diffusion</em>, <em>multimodal models</em>, and <em>deep reinforcement learning</em>.</p>

<p>Previously, I worked with the <a href="https://www.epic.gatech.edu/">Exoskeleton and Prosthetic Intelligent Controls lab</a> at Georgia Tech as an undergraduate researcher
where I work on improving machine learning models and experimentation for powered knee prosthesis.</p>